 any alternative schedule could be earlier? Could we start A later? No, starting earlier is beneficial. Could we schedule B and C overlapping differently? Since we have two workers, we can do both concurrently after A. That's optimal. Could we start B before A? No, B depends on A. Could we start C before A? No. So the critical path length is A (30) + max(B (40), C (20)) + D (30) = 30+40+30 = 100 minutes = 1 hour 40 minutes. Starting at 09:00 yields finish at 10:40.\n\nThus earliest finish time is 10:40.\n\nNow schedule: we need to output schedule: maybe a table with tasks, assigned worker, start time, finish time.\n\nWe have two workers: W1, W2.\n\nWe need to assign tasks to workers. Many possible assignments. For simplicity, assign A to W1, B to W2, C to W1 (or W2). Let's assign:\n\n- A: W1, start 09:00, finish 09:30.\n- After A, both workers free. Let's assign B to W2, start 09:30, finish 10:10.\n- Assign C to W1, start 09:30, finish 09:50.\n- D: assign to whichever is free after 10:10. Both are free. Let's assign D to W2 (or W1). Let's assign D to W2, start 10:10, finish 10:40.\n\nAlternatively, assign D to W1. Both fine.\n\nThus schedule:\n\n| 任务 | 工人 | 开始时间 | 结束时间 |\n|----|----|----|----|\n| A | W1 | 09:00 | 09:30 |\n| C | W1 | 09:30 | 09:50 |\n| B | W2 | 09:30 | 10:10 |\n| D | W2 | 10:10 | 10:40 |\n\nAlternatively, could assign C to W2 and B to W1. But either works.\n\nThus earliest finish time: 10:40.\n\nWe need to output earliest finish time and schedule.\n\nThe user wrote Chinese: \"09:00起 W1/W2 两人；A30分钟无依赖，B40依赖A，C20依赖A，D30依赖B和C，每任务一人完整完成。输出最早 finish_time 和 schedule。\"\n\nThus answer: earliest finish time: 10:40. schedule as above.\n\nWe might also compute critical path and confirm.\n\nThus answer: 10:40, schedule.\n\nWe could also output in a JSON format or table.\n\nBetter to output in Chinese.\n\nThus:\n\n最早完成时间: 10:40\n\n日程安排:\n\n- 任务 A: 由 W1 于 09:00 开始，30分钟，结束 09:30。\n- 任务 B: 由 W2 于 09:30 开始，40分钟，结束 10:10。\n- 任务 C: 由 W1 于 09:30 开始，20分钟，结束 09:50。\n- 任务